>>
Rule 15 (axes as a list of two integers with support for negative indexing)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : list(int)} |= v_3.len = 2 ∧ v_3[0] ≥ 0 - ndim(v_1) ∧ v_3[0] < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_3[1] ≥ 0 - ndim(v_2) ∧ v_3[1] < ndim(v_2) ∧ shape(v_1, (if v_3[0] ≥ 0 then v_3[0] else ndim(v_1) + v_3[0])) = shape(v_2, (if v_3[1] ≥ 0 then v_3[1] else ndim(v_2) + v_3[1]))
